Thought: The mass spectrometry data indicates a molecular ion peak at m/z 182.073, which is likely the molecular weight of the compound. To deduce the molecular formula, I should consider the isotopic distribution and potential elements involved. Next, I will retrieve the isotopic distribution to help interpret the mass spectrometry data.
